BLOCKER

A duly authorized project owner must select and approve a license before the
workspace is distributed, accepts external contributions, or is presented as
open source. The decision must also address:

- the copyright holder and copyright notice;
- inbound contribution terms;
- compatibility requirements for dependencies and generated artifacts;
- whether all repositories use one license or repository-specific licenses;
- whether documentation and examples use the same terms as source code.

Track this unresolved decision in docs/ambiguity-register.md. Replace this file
only after the decision is recorded and approved.
